My guess is that you have not installed the standard header files
component.  Do a 
	
	setld -i | grep OSFINCLUDE

the output should be 

	OSFINCLUDE500        installed  Standard Header Files (Software
Development)
	(note: the 500 is for v5.0 only, your system may have a different
number)

If you don't see the "installed" string, use setld to install
OSFINCLUDExxx from your distribution media.

groetjes

Ton Verhulst


