Are you sure that the SCSI ID for the tape device does not duplicate
the SCSI ID of your boot disk?

I've done this type of thing to myself from time to time when adding
equipment.  Having 2 devices respond to a SCSI read request can really
mess things up.  So far I have been lucky that this hasn't overwritten
my disks, but your mileage may vary.

Good luck.



